After four years, the math finally caught up with me. At $26 for a two-month supply, I started looking for alternatives — and found Bronson Liver Detox carrying nearly identical ingredients at $27 for a full year's supply. That's $129 back in your pocket annually. Bronson has been around since 1960 and holds GMP certification, so the quality holds up. I'll be reviewing the Bronson in the coming months.
